# technical stack

– Vite – Fast builds & development.
– TypeScript – Type safety & maintainability.
– React.js – Interactive, component-based UI.
– ShadCN-UI – Elegant, pre-built UI components.
– Tailwind CSS – Utility-first styling.
– Icons: Lucide Icons for UI elements.
– Backend: Supabase – Handles database, authentication, and storage.
– Database: PostgreSQL for relational data.
– Search Engine: Supabase Full-Text Search** – Fast job search without
Elasticsearch.
– File Storage: Supabase Storage – Store CVs, company logos, etc